PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

POLYCENTER NetWorker Save and Restore V3.2 provides the industry-leading
Legato NetWorker technology for Digital UNIX cluster systems. This
software release ensures consistent, reliable, backup, recovery, and
archival services for the entire network. New features

o  Support for the TruCluster and DECsafe Available Server Environment (ASE)
   products, and the storage associated with an ASE service

o  Back up file systems for NFS or disk services served by ASE or cluster
   systems. These services and their associated storage may migrate or
   failover between the actual nodes in the environment. Networker treats
   these services as independent clients, and store the associated indexes
   under the name of the service.The user can back up and recover stored
   data associated with a service independent of the node currently serving
   it

o  Save Set Consolidation (SSC), available for Digital UNIX clients, takes
   incremental backups and consolidates them into a new full (or level)
   backup; further backups are changed files only. SSC

   - Reduces network traffic and
   - Reduces client resource usage
   - Decreases amount of data to be backed up

This release does not support having the NetWorker server itself fail
over between ASE hosts.

