PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

TeamLinks V2.5 for Macintosh is a suite of integrated groupware
applications (Office, Mail, Routing, Conferencing, Library Services, and
Calendar Manager) that is designed for team members in remote locations
and those who are traveling. It is based on proven client/server
technology.

