SERVICES

Three-year hardware warranty

o  Year 1 -- Digital will provide onsite hardware support, on a next
   business day basis, Monday through Friday, excluding locally observed
   Digital holidays. All parts and labor to repair the hardware problem are
   provided.

o  Years 2 and 3 -- Digital will provide repair services through carry-in to
